    "name_raw": "Artful Dodge",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Melee Tactics Toolbox pg. 7",
    "definition_raw": "Source Melee Tactics Toolbox pg. 7\nYou are practiced at avoiding attacks when outnumbered.\n\nPrerequisites: Int 13.\n\nBenefit: If you are the only character threatening an opponent, you gain a +1 dodge bonus to AC against that opponent.\n\nSpecial: The Artful Dodge feat acts as the Dodge feat for the purpose of satisfying prerequisites that require Dodge. You can use Intelligence, rather than Dexterity, for feats with a minimum Dexterity prerequisite.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "Melee Tactics Toolbox pg. 7",
